

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
https://peer-lend-production.up.railway.app


### Record a Transaction (Local)
POST {{base_url}}/transactions/record
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loan_id": 1,
  "type": "repayment",
  "amount": 250
}

### Record a Transaction (Production)
POST {{prod_url}}/transactions/record
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loan_id": 1,
  "type": "repayment",
  "amount": 250
}


### List Transactions for Loan (Local)
GET {{base_url}}/transactions/loan/1

### List Transactions for Loan (Production)
GET {{prod_url}}/transactions/loan/1
